NOTE ON DATA AND DOCUMENTATION

This licence covers the source code only.

The ROAD dataset is NOT redistributed here. It is obtained from Zenodo
(DOI 10.13139/ORNLNCCS/1728694) under CC BY 4.0 by running
`make data-road`. Cite Verma et al. (arXiv:2012.14600) when using it.
The HCRL Car-Hacking dataset is NOT redistributed either; it is fetched from
its publisher by `make data-hcrl`. Cite Song et al. (2020) when using it.

The documentation (README.md) and the result files under results/ are
released under CC BY 4.0.
